* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 5
* <Natural Source Header
* RDEFNO - Define a Mainframe Node (Template:RDEFUX)
*
* Maintenance
* uuuuuu yyyy-mm-dd iTrac       Comment
* fhi    2015-05-05 NOMALL-1478 created
* fhi    2018-01-18 NOMALL-1917 Enhance handling of email address field
* SU1    2018-03-27             handle monitor in error correct
* SU2    2018-03-27             remote node BS2: copy must be Y
* fhi    2018-04-25 NOMALL-1918 Introduce monitor type error ('E')
* fhi    2018-07-19 NOMALL-1918 same / Status 'E' erfunden
* SU3    2018-07-27             monitor:no 2. one(new)+no spool change+
*        ESY/NPR error does not change status+NPR5999->999+CP for remote
* SU4    2018-07-31             store BS2 device without H'FF'
* fhi    2018-10-04 NOMALL-1621 Down status is char 'I' instead of '-'
* fhi    2018-11-07 NOMALL-1620 Use email recipients in 8.1.2 only
* BLI    2018-11-19 NOMALL-2176 NOM node number: up to 65535
* BLI    2019-01-24 NOMALL-1621 Use 'inactive: I' instead of 'down'
* SU5    2019-10-17 NOMALL-2329 avoid NAT1009/dump if to much ADA calls
* SU6    2020-01-27             avoid Adabas calls exceeded (INT-ID=0)
* BLI    2020-05-07 NOMALL-2309 access rights Monitor System Defaults
* SU7    2020-06-04 NOMALL-2349 use N-ESYLGg
* SU8    2020-11-10 NOMALL-2440 split DDM -> NRM-MF-NODES
* SU9    2021-07-09 NOMALL-2475 add node:avoid err. in monitor
* SU10   2021-08-26 NOMALL-2484 field M-BS2-DEST only if BS2 node
* BLI    2021-09-24 NOMALL-2498 Status vs. MF-TYPE
* SU11   2022-03-16 NOMALL-2539 monitor down: avoid to much ADA calls+
*                   NOMALL-2538 ÜÜÜ avoid TYPE=S (RMINIT NAT1116+..)ÜÜÜ
* SU12   2022-03-16 ES-32029    Spool Class "SYSOUT" optional
* SU13   2022-09-19 NOMALL-2578 check trigger for remote BS2
* SU14   2024-03-07 ES-34613    NOM 3.6 Remove power
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
DEFINE DATA GLOBAL USING NRM-GL
*
INDEPENDENT
1 +G-NOMEXIT-ACTIVE         (L/1:20)
1 +NOD-LOCAL-NAME           (A16)
1 +NOD-LOCAL-SPOOL-TYPE     (A8)
*
LOCAL USING RPFK---L
LOCAL USING RMSETSTE
LOCAL USING XXGMSG-A
LOCAL USING RLOG-L
LOCAL USING EOMFLD-E /*for NOMEX007
*
LOCAL
1 #MF-NODES VIEW OF NRM-MF-NODES /*SU8 NRM-MONITOR
1 UX-NODES VIEW OF NRM-UX-NODES
1 REPORTS VIEW OF NRM-REPORTS-NEW
  2 R-INTERNAL-NODE-ID
1 MF-NODE VIEW OF NRM-MF-NODES /*SU8 NRM-MONITOR
  2 MF-MONITOR-NODE /*number
  2 MF-SPOOL-TYPE
  2 MF-SYSTEM-TYPE
